          "Build authentic engagement with the 17.09% Hispanic community through workplace organizing partnerships, healthcare access advocacy, and agricultural labor protections; this is the largest minority constituency in the district and represents a significant swing capacity in a primary or genuinely contested general election.",
          "Engage the younger adult majority (median age 35.0) on specific pathways to economic mobility — housing affordability, workforce development, and whether state education and training investments are enabling or constraining their generation's ability to build stable lives in Idaho."
