          { name: "Urban-Centric Progressive Priorities", tag: "avoid", why: "This is a rural, property-owning, low-renter-rate district (17.6%) with minimal urban characteristics. Candidates pitching urban density, transit-oriented development, or tenant-focused regulation will alienate the core constituency. The 85.89% white, land-owning profile and resource-based economy make these messaging frames strategically irrelevant and counterproductive." }
