          "Lead on economic security for working-class homeowners: At $75,583 income with 75% homeownership, this is a constituency for whom property taxes, healthcare costs, and housing affordability are material concerns, not abstractions. Any candidate who addresses these directly—with concrete policy positions on property tax relief, healthcare access, or housing supply—is speaking to the actual economic anxiety that likely drove the 8-point swing.",
